 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Help I’m in Love With a Scam Artist!"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "Hey buddy, you ever been scammed before?\nNo!? Well, you wanna be scammed?\nNO!? Then what the hell are you here for?\nThis book is about falling for a scam artist!\n\nMeet Masahi, a 22-year-old video game designer.\nHe thinks he's found the perfect girl online: she's a gamer, she's gorgeous, and she always pays her way. It sounds like a dream come true, right?\nBut the dream teeters on the brink of a nightmare as Masahi starts to question whether she's really who she claims to be.\nIs she truly the girl of his dreams, or is she a masterful scam artist?\n\nDive into \"Help I’m in Love With a Scam Artist\" and unravel the thrilling mystery of love and deceit in the digital age."
  },
